{"asset_key":"mn2/herohub_story_10413020","episode":"mn2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10413020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1041302001:1":{"text":"そういえばボク、今でも学生時代が本当に恋しくなるんだ。あの頃の最大の悩みは、どうやって成績を伸ばすかってことくらいだったよ。今と大違いだ……","source_cn":"说起来，我还真怀念我上学的时候，最大的烦恼只是怎么学好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93A64ACD597C2B7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041302002:1":{"text":"そうだ、ボクが入学する前は、姉さんはどんな感じだったの？","source_cn":"对了，我还没入学的时候，莱卡是怎么样的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164B6D329E46E776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041302003:1":{"text":"お姉さんのことが気になり出したんですね。彼女の学生時代ですか、ふふ。今と全然違ってて、すごく面白かったですよ。","source_cn":"开始关心姐姐了啊~她上学的时候啊，哈哈，和现在很不一样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ED92120D886F75D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1041302003":{"text":"お姉さんのことが気になり出したんですね。彼女の学生時代ですか、ふふ。今と全然違ってて、すごく面白かったですよ。","source_cn":"开始关心姐姐了啊~她上学的时候啊，哈哈，和现在很不一样，非常有意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ED92120D886F75D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041302004:1":{"text":"入学したてのライカですね……可愛くて人懐っこくて、いつも私の後ろをついて走り回るのが好きでした。","source_cn":"刚入学的莱卡呀……那时候又可爱又黏人，总喜欢跟在我后面...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00E69A373AD3509D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041302005:1":{"text":"君たちは知らないでしょうけど、意志が強くて勇敢で頼りになる我らがライカは、学生時代は泣き虫だったんですよ！","source_cn":"你们还不知道吧，咱们现在坚强勇敢又可靠的莱卡，上学的时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8807B6C680C98E08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041302006:1":{"text":"泣く時は、他の人に見られないようにいつも私のところに来ていました。テストでエルロンやパリーサに負けたり、アーチェリーで的に当てられなかったり、とあるいたずらっ子に腹が立ったり……","source_cn":"她哭的时候总会来找我，不想让别人看到。不管是考试输给埃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7D10E21A33427451","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041302007:1":{"text":"えぇっ！？ははは……ダメだ、姉さんに過去をよーく「思い出して」もらわないと！","source_cn":"什么？！哈哈哈……不行，我得去找她好好“回忆”一下过往！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ACD9A7010878524","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041302008:1":{"text":"……フラベル先輩！やめてください、それ以上喋らないでください！","source_cn":"——芙拉贝尔！快停下，别继续说啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF55D0FE305299A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041302009:1":{"text":"ライカ、どうして先輩に向かってそんな風にすごむんです？はぁ、あの時君の涙を拭いてあげたのは誰でしたっけ……","source_cn":"莱卡，怎么对学姐这么凶啊？唉，当初是谁帮你擦的眼泪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0C54F921B98BB2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041302010:1":{"text":"やめてください……お願いですから……","source_cn":"别说了……拜托……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2197C2B316349FCB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041302011:1":{"text":"姉さん、もっとボクに学生時代の話をしてよ！","source_cn":"莱卡，再给我讲讲你上学时候的事情呗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A301FEF3CD9D24D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041302012:1":{"text":"……あっ、待ってよ！すっごく楽しいのに！","source_cn":"——唉，别走嘛！这么好玩的事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59EB381F57F73F33","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:0:1":{"text":"そんなことを言われると、僕まで気になってきたよ。","source_cn":"你说得我都有点好奇了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x65BCDBFF091D5DC3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"そんなことを言われると、僕まで気になってきたよ。","female":"そんなことを言われると、私まで気になってきたわ。","variant_male_record_index":"61540","variant_female_record_index":"61541","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:6:1:2":{"text":"たとえば？","source_cn":"举个例子？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x489E839153411151","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"たとえば？","female":"たとえば？"